# Data Processing Agreement (DPA)

This Data Processing Agreement is entered into between NexaTech Solutions Inc. ("Processor") and Customer ("Controller").

## 1. Definitions
Terms used in this DPA have the meanings set forth in the GDPR.

## 2. Scope and Purpose
Processor will process Personal Data on behalf of Controller for the purpose of providing the Services.

## 3. Processor Obligations
Processor shall:
- Process Personal Data only on documented instructions from Controller
- Ensure confidentiality of persons authorized to process Personal Data
- Implement appropriate technical and organizational measures
- Assist Controller in responding to data subject requests
- Notify Controller of any Personal Data breaches

## 4. Sub-Processors
Processor may engage sub-processors with Controller's prior written consent. Current sub-processors are listed at www.nexatech-solutions.com/sub-processors.

## 5. Data Transfers
Processor may transfer Personal Data outside the EEA only with appropriate safeguards in place (e.g., Standard Contractual Clauses).

## 6. Audit Rights
Controller may audit Processor's compliance with this DPA once per year with 30 days' notice.

